data: {"id": "5aa2093a54484be2-thinking-parallel_evidence-855", "run_id": "5aa2093a54484be2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期与退出码**：`kubectl describe` 确认 Pod 状态为 Running，但 container `app` 处于 CrashLoopBackOff。Last State Terminated 的 Exit Code 为 **127**，Reason 为 **Error**；重启计数 **13**。PromQL 同样确认 `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason=1` (reason=Error) 和 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=13`。\n2. **previous logs**：`kubectl logs --previous -c app` 返回关键日志：`sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。ES/Filebeat 日志（6 条记录）也全部是同一错误原文，覆盖最近 30 分钟每次重启窗口。\n3. **Pod YAML 配置**：", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789134418320, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

